</pre>

<h3> UNDERSTANDING ANCIENT CHINA DEEPLY</h3>

<p>
Ancient China was not built only through military power.
</p>

<p>
Its strength came from creating systems that balanced:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Authority</li>
<li>Morality</li>
<li>Social order</li>
<li>Administration</li>
<li>Cultural continuity</li>
