</li>

</ul>

<h3> THE IMPORTANCE OF THE YELLOW RIVER</h3>

<p>
Ancient Chinese civilization developed around the Yellow River.
</p>

<p>
The river provided:
</p>

<ul>

<li>
 Water supply
