</li>

<li>
How did the system influence industrial growth?
</li>

<li>
What is meant by African diaspora?
</li>

<li>
How did the Atlantic Slave Trade affect Africa?
</li>

<li>
Why is this history still important today?
</li>

<li>
What were abolition movements?
</li>

<li>
How did the trade shape modern global inequality?
</li>

<li>
What major lesson does the Atlantic Slave Trade teach about global systems?
</li>

</ol>

<h3> ANSWERS</h3>

<ol>

<li>
