</li>

<li>
Because plantations required large labor forces to produce export crops.
</li>

<li>
A trade network linking Europe, Africa, and the Americas.
</li>

<li>
The forced Atlantic Ocean journey of enslaved Africans.
</li>

<li>
Crops grown mainly for international sale and profit.
</li>

<li>
