<h3> ANIMALS EXCHANGED</h3>

<p>
Animals also moved between continents.
</p>

<p>
Europeans brought:
</p>

<ul>

<li> Horses</li>

<li> Cattle</li>

<li> Pigs</li>

<li> Sheep</li>

<li> Goats</li>

</ul>

<p>
to the Americas.
