<h3> ENVIRONMENTAL IMPACT</h3>

<p>
The Columbian Exchange transformed ecosystems worldwide.
</p>

<p>
New species entering ecosystems often caused:
</p>

<ul>

<li>Environmental imbalance</li>

<li>Deforestation</li>

<li>Soil changes</li>

<li>Species displacement</li>

<li>Changes in biodiversity</li>

</ul>

<p>
Human activity now began reshaping the planet on a global scale.
</p>

<p>
This marks one of the early stages of:
</p>

<pre>
Global environmental transformation.
</pre>

