<li>Steamships</li>

<li>Mining systems</li>

</ul>

<p><b>Step 6: Steam Release & Repeat Cycle</b></p>

<p>
Steam exits or condenses,
and the cycle repeats continuously.
</p>

<h3> WHY THE STEAM ENGINE CHANGED HISTORY</h3>

<p>
The steam engine dramatically increased:
</p>

<ul>

<li> Productivity</li>

<li> Manufacturing speed</li>

<li> Transportation capacity</li>

<li> International trade</li>

<li> Supply movement</li>

<li> Mining production</li>

