<p><b>Step 6: Social Transformation</b></p>

<p>
Urban societies develop:
</p>

<ul>

<li>New social classes</li>

<li>Industrial workers</li>

<li>Middle classes</li>

<li>Urban elites</li>

</ul>

<p><b>Step 7: Long-Term Urban Civilization</b></p>

<p>
Cities become permanent centers of:
</p>

<ul>

<li>Economics</li>

<li>Politics</li>

<li>Technology</li>

<li>Education</li>

<li>Culture</li>

</ul>

<h3> EARLY INDUSTRIAL CITIES</h3>

